  m_Name: Note_Shipwreck
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NoteName: Shipwreck Note
  NoteHeader: Crewmate's Diary (1/3)
  NoteText: "Our boat was wiped out by a huge storm, and ever since me and my crew
    have beeneternally lost in this otherwordly ocean.\nAll sense of the world I
    knew is gone, whilst my crew is optimistic of escape, I\u2019m really worried.\r\nEveryday
    is some new outlandish encounter, just today was some huge eyeball island, plagued
    with these fish with eyeballs equally as creepy\r\nRight now, escape feels impossible.
    But, with my crew with me, I at least have some hope. I hope things improve soon.\r\n"
